-- 266 [s 25(3)(b), l.161] 1 day before Saturday 2025-12-27 counts to Friday 12-26; 12-25 holiday: 2025-12-24
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the beginning or end of a period for doing an act, moved off a holiday` `test: my holiday calendar` `The reference day is after the period` (`s 25.2 beginning or end of a period of days` (YMD 2025 12 27) `The reference day is after the period` 1 FALSE) EQUALS YMD 2025 12 24
-- 267 [s 25(3)(a), l.160] 1 day after 2025-12-31 counts to Thursday 2026-01-01: 2026-01-02
#ASSERT `s 25(3) the beginning or end of a period for doing an act, moved off a holiday` `test: my holiday calendar` `The reference day is before the period` (`s 25.2 beginning or end of a period of days` (YMD 2025 12 31) `The reference day is before the period` 1 FALSE) EQUALS YMD 2026 1 2
-- 268 [s 25(3)(a), l.160] 1 day after Sunday 2022-12-25 counts to Monday 2022-12-26 (December 26): 2022-12-27
