#ASSERT (`the span of days of a period for doing an act` `test: my holiday calendar` (YMD 2025 1 4) `The reference day is before the period` (`test: period` Days 1 FALSE))'s `first day` EQUALS YMD 2025 1 6
-- 270 [s 25(3), l.159] a period NOT for doing an act counted to end on Sunday 2025-01-12 ends 2025-01-12 (no shift)
#ASSERT `s 25.2 beginning or end of a period of days` (YMD 2025 1 5) `The reference day is before the period` 7 FALSE EQUALS YMD 2025 1 12
